{"id":"3b1eea2c458fe5be","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SFull.md","title":"SFull","display":"SFull","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"SFull","parameters":["D","K"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"SFull"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>D</span><span>K</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：二阶语法与语义。有序参数：<code>D</code>、<code>K</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ SFull D K)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(and\n  (@ SRelDomains D K)\n  (forall n\n    (implies (@ Nat n) (exists T (exists P (and (@ FTuples D n T) (and (@ Power T P) (@ App K n P))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"879692e175100c7e\" href=\"?note=879692e175100c7e\" title=\"ZFC_FTuples\">FTuples</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e2136a636857d477\" href=\"?note=e2136a636857d477\" title=\"ZFC_Nat\">Nat</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5d77373a330f372f\" href=\"?note=5d77373a330f372f\" title=\"ZFC_Power\">Power</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"34e58e195eb37fee\" href=\"?note=34e58e195eb37fee\" title=\"ZFC_SRelDomains\">SRelDomains</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ SFull D K)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FTuples|FTuples]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_Power|Power]]；[[ZFC_SRelDomains|SRelDomains]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FTuples","status":"resolved","id":"879692e175100c7e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FTuples|FTuples]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_Power|Power]]；[[ZFC_SRelDomains|SRelDomains]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Nat","status":"resolved","id":"e2136a636857d477","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FTuples|FTuples]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_Power|Power]]；[[ZFC_SRelDomains|SRelDomains]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Power","status":"resolved","id":"5d77373a330f372f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FTuples|FTuples]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_Power|Power]]；[[ZFC_SRelDomains|SRelDomains]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_SRelDomains","status":"resolved","id":"34e58e195eb37fee","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FTuples|FTuples]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_Power|Power]]；[[ZFC_SRelDomains|SRelDomains]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务","status":"resolved","id":"593f9bdab4d60707","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"证明状态","excerpt":"本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理